<title>USA: Maricopa Cty Hosp Dist 1, Ariz., won by Hutchinson.</title>
<headline>Maricopa Cty Hosp Dist 1, Ariz., won by Hutchinson.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson, Shockey Erley &amp; Co. said it won $5 million of Maricopa Cty Hospital District 1, Ariz., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 6.11 percent.</p>
</text>
